        "id": 1074459
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-06T16:36:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, I\u0027m trying to follow the current model. Framework provides the ifname it is interested in. \n\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/android/frameworks/opt/net/wifi/service/java/com/android/server/wifi/WifiNative.java?rcl\u003de2b3915ca8abad6914c081eec05c41fdb60dbf09\u0026l\u003d129\n\n\nIn the future if we have 2 STA iface\u0027s, wlan0 \u0026 wlan1. We should let framework create the STA iface on whichever the iface it wants.",
      "parentUuid": "1f99cc37_580625fb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 224,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 224,
        "endChar": 30
      },
